{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding without image data or fusion, establishing a baseline for single-profile RNA representation. Validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464 suggest moderate performance, but no comparative evidence exists to assess the impact of encoding choices or aggregation methods. The role of PCA versus alternative encoders or fusion strategies remains uncertain without additional experiments."
}

